    "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2023 gross claims outstanding were GBP 811.6m. During 2023 the Syndicate's prior-year development was adverse (strengthening) by approximately GBP 27.5m (3.4% of opening gross reserves), driven by adverse development on the 2021 underwriting year and weather/geopolitical-related impacts. This was materially offset on an aggregate basis by the reinsurance-to-close (RITC)/loss portfolio transfer arrangements which removed substantial liabilities (notably the 2020 & prior RITC/LPT transfers). The net effect was a reduction in gross outstanding reserves to GBP 533.3m at 31 December 2023, with the movement reflecting a combination of prior-year strengthening, current year claims activity and large RITC transfers.",
